  <!-- INTRO -->
  <section class="section section-soft stripe-top" aria-labelledby="intro-title">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-header">
        <h2 class="section-title" id="intro-title">What is facade signage?</h2>
        <p class="section-subtitle">Every type of business signage on the exterior of your building &mdash; from name and logo to opening hours and graphic elements.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:var(--space-9);align-items:start;">
        <div class="prose">
          <p>Facade signage is the first thing a customer sees before your door &mdash; literally. A well-considered facade says more about your business than ten advertisements or a thousand social media followers. It can be a business card that works daily for ten to fifteen years, or a cheap applied sign that fades within a season and damages your image. The difference lies in materials, installation and design that fits your building and neighbourhood.</p>
          <p>We have been doing facade signage for Rotterdam SMEs since 2012. From simple vinyl lettering on a shop front to complete LED channel letters on a commercial building. Photo via WhatsApp, mockup within two days, installation on-site. This is what facade signage at Alfa Reclame concretely means.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="prose">
          <p>For every type we maintain the same standard: A-brand materials, installation by the owner, two-year warranty on materials and installation (five-year manufacturer warranty on LED modules). No intermediaries, no delays from subcontracting, no surprises afterwards. One quote, one point of contact, two-year warranty on all delivered work.</p>
          <p>Whether you want to dress a new commercial property, update your shop front or give your hospitality venue an evening presence &mdash; we always start with a free on-site consultation to assess the options and draw up a realistic quote.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- FOUR TYPES -->
  <section class="section" aria-labelledby="types-title">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-header">
        <span class="eyebrow">Four main types</span>
        <h2 class="section-title" id="types-title">Types of facade signage</h2>
        <p class="section-subtitle">Four solutions for every budget, every facade style and every visual effect.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card-grid">
        <article class="card">
          <h3 class="card__title">Vinyl lettering</h3>
          <p class="card__body">Self-adhesive film applied directly to the facade, glazing or cladding. Quick to install and cost-effective &mdash; ideal for business name, opening hours and simple logos. Cut vinyl or full-colour print. Five to seven year outdoor lifespan. Always with laminate against scratching and UV fading.</p>
          <span class="card__link">From &euro;295</span>
        </article>
        <article class="card">
          <h3 class="card__title">3D dimensional letters</h3>
          <p class="card__body">CNC-milled from PVC or Dibond, stand-off mounted on the facade. Give a two-dimensional material a three-dimensional shadow effect. PVC for letters up to 30 cm; Dibond for large letters and high facades. Lifespan 15&ndash;25 years.</p>
          <span class="card__link">From &euro;795</span>
        </article>
        <article class="card">
          <h3 class="card__title">Light box (LED)</h3>
          <p class="card__body">Rectangular or shaped box with internal LED. Face in printed vinyl or milled acrylic. Works both day and night. Standard sizes up to 200&times;60 cm. Ten to fifteen year lifespan. Single or double-sided.</p>
          <span class="card__link">From &euro;1,495</span>
        </article>
        <article class="card">
          <h3 class="card__title">Channel letters</h3>
          <p class="card__body">Individually lit LED letters, each with its own aluminium or acrylic housing. Each letter illuminates independently &mdash; premium architectural look. Front-lit or halo-lit. Popular with retailers, offices and hospitality. Aluminium housing with acrylic face; trim-cap finish available.</p>
          <span class="card__link">From &euro;2,495</span>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- MATERIALS -->
