    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-header" style="max-width:720px;">
        <span class="eyebrow">Materials &amp; quality</span>
        <h2 class="section-title" id="materials-title">Materials and lifespan</h2>
        <p class="section-subtitle">Facade signage is exposed to weather daily &mdash; we use only materials with proven UV and weather resistance.</p>
      </div>
      <ul class="mat-list">
        <li>
          <span class="mat-label">Vinyl film</span>
          <span class="mat-desc">Cast vinyl from 3M, Avery Dennison, Hexis and Orafol. UV-stable colours, five to seven years outdoors. Always with laminate against scratching and fading.</span>
        </li>
        <li>
          <span class="mat-label">PVC</span>
          <span class="mat-desc">For 3D dimensional letters up to 30 cm high. Lighter and more economical than Dibond. Fifteen to twenty year outdoor lifespan.</span>
        </li>
